{"seq":6,"slug":"controversies-and-appraisal","title":"穆斯塔法·凯末尔·争议与多元评价","stage":"DONE","category":"mustafa-kemal-ataturk","categoryLabel":"穆斯塔法·凯末尔","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mustafa-kemal-ataturk/controversies-and-appraisal","rating":{"composite":3.51,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/leaders/21_mustafa-kemal-ataturk/6_controversies-and-appraisal","introHtml":"<p>把凯末尔只当作&quot;国父&quot;来记忆，恰恰是对他最大的简化。这个侧面不复述他缔造现代土耳其的功业，而是把镜头转向那些至今仍有争论的地方：他为什么在 1925 年借谢赫赛义德叛乱通过《取缔法》(Takrir-i Sükûn)、解散进步共和党、建立起事实上的一党专政；1930 年由他亲自授意成立的自由共和党为何只存活了 99 天便被解散；他凭什么在 1924 年废除哈里发、1925 年关闭全部苏菲教团道堂、1937 年把&quot;世俗主义&quot;写进宪法，这些自上而下、强力推行的改造又在土耳其社会内部留下了怎样的裂痕；以及库尔德人在这场国家建构中付出了什么代价。</p>\n<p>它面向的是想看到一个完整、立体、可被追问的凯末尔的普通历史读者——不是要把他拉下神坛，而是相信只有把争议一并讲清，赞誉才站得住。每一处争论都尽量给出多方声音、具体年份与可核验的事件（1924 年废哈里发、1925 年《取缔法》与帽子法、1928 年文字改革、1937 年世俗主义入宪），而非简单的褒或贬。</p>\n<p>它与兄弟侧面分工明确：<a href=\"../life-and-career/\">生平与事业</a>叙述&quot;发生了什么&quot;的完整时间线；<a href=\"../core-policies/\">核心政策</a>讲他执政时推行的共和、世俗化与现代化制度安排；<a href=\"../political-thought/\">政治思想</a>梳理凯末尔主义&quot;六支箭&quot;的内在逻辑；<a href=\"../major-events/\">重大事件</a>聚焦加里波利、独立战争与文字改革等里程碑节点；<a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与历史地位</a>评估他留给土耳其与世界的长远遗产。本侧面不重复这些&quot;是什么&quot;，而专门处理&quot;该如何评判&quot;——把那些被国父光环遮住的棱角，重新摆回历史的天平上。</p>\n<p>三章依次展开：<a href=\"authoritarian-rule/\">威权统治</a>处理一党专政的形成与库尔德问题；<a href=\"forced-secularization/\">强制世俗化</a>审视自上而下的改造及其引发的宗教抵抗；<a href=\"diverse-appraisals/\">多元的评价</a>直面&quot;解放者还是独裁者&quot;的追问与史学定论。读者既可顺序通读，也可带着某个具体疑问直接跳入相应章节。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"authoritarian-rule","title":"威权统治","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mustafa-kemal-ataturk/controversies-and-appraisal/authoritarian-rule","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"one-party-rule","title":"一党统治","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mustafa-kemal-ataturk/controversies-and-appraisal/authoritarian-rule/one-party-rule"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-kurdish-question","title":"库尔德问题","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mustafa-kemal-ataturk/controversies-and-appraisal/authoritarian-rule/the-kurdish-question"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"forced-secularization","title":"激进世俗化","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mustafa-kemal-ataturk/controversies-and-appraisal/forced-secularization","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"top-down-transformation","title":"自上而下的改造","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mustafa-kemal-ataturk/controversies-and-appraisal/forced-secularization/top-down-transformation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"religion-and-resistance","title":"宗教与抵抗","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mustafa-kemal-ataturk/controversies-and-appraisal/forced-secularization/religion-and-resistance"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"diverse-appraisals","title":"多元评价","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mustafa-kemal-ataturk/controversies-and-appraisal/diverse-appraisals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"liberator-or-autocrat","title":"解放者还是独裁者","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mustafa-kemal-ataturk/controversies-and-appraisal/diverse-appraisals/liberator-or-autocrat"},{"seq":2,"slug":"historical-assessment","title":"历史地位的评判","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mustafa-kemal-ataturk/controversies-and-appraisal/diverse-appraisals/historical-assessment"}]}]}